**Ancel** (Heroic). A twelve-year-old pianist who is secretly a
hitman. Ancel looks like an ordinary twelve-year-old boy, but anyone
who spends time with him notices something deeper: a composure,
insight, and self-supporting life as a pianist that don't fit his age.
Playing piano is only his cover. He's a hitman, equipped with every
kind of weapon and gadget and very good at the job. Clients never meet
him, targets never survive him, and his youthful look is the ideal
disguise. Nobody knows his past. *Agile +2, Art of Invisibility +3,
Attack +2 (Tools of the Trade), Combat Expert +4, Dimensional Pocket
+3, Evasive +2, Intuitive +2, Knowledge +4 (Piano), Perceptive +2,
Quick +1, Wealthy +2; Ageism -1, Emotionless -1, Frail -2, Fussy -1,
Ineptitude -2 (Speaking Face-to-Face), Secret -3 (Assassin), Soft Spot
-2 (Music), Wanted -3 (The Law), Weak -2.* Handgun (Effective, Ranged;
Weapon): Roll 8, DX 4, End 0. Happiness is a warm gun. Well, Ancel
never seems to be happy, but close enough. Sniper Rifle (Impairing,
Ranged; Delayed, Weapon): Roll 8, DX 3, End 0. What better way to
carry out one's work but from afar and well out of harm's way? Length
of Wire (Paralyzing x2; Low Penetration x2): Roll 8, DX 1, End 10. If
left without other means, Ancel knows how to improvise to take down a
target, even if his small frame makes the effort exhausting.
Defense 5. Health 20, Endurance 40. TV 14.

